What is the output of the following Java 17 program?

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int k = 2;
        switch (k) {
            case 1:
                System.out.print("A");
            case 2:
                System.out.print("B");
            case 3:
                System.out.print("C");
                break;
            default:
                System.out.print("D");
        }
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following Java 17 program?

```java
public class Main {
    static void a() {
        try {
            b();
            System.out.print("0");
        } finally {
            System.out.print("1");
        }
    }

    static void b() {
        throw new IllegalStateException("bad state");
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            a();
        } catch (RuntimeException e) {
            System.out.print("2");
        } finally {
            System.out.print("3");
        }
    }
}
```

