What is the output of the following Java 17 program?

```java
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<String> names = List.of("Asha", "Ravi");
        List<String> copy = new ArrayList<>(names);
        copy.add("Kiran");
        try {
            names.add("Meera");
        } catch (UnsupportedOperationException e) {
            System.out.print("U");
        }
        System.out.print(names.size() + "" + copy.size());
    }
}
```

